- Committed RED_TEST_COMMAND `node --test plugins/dsh-measure-guard/tests/*.test.js` from the repo root -> EXIT=1, 384 tests (PASS=383, FAIL=1). The only failure is the new dsh mapping test.
- Full `bun test` in plugins/opencode-measure-guard -> EXIT=1, 187 tests (PASS=186, FAIL=1). The only failure is the new mapping test; no other known failures.
